message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite as below."
title: "gannon-storm-rtk-analysis"
abstract: "Retrospective analysis of RTK-GNSS positioning error during the May 10-12, 2024 Gannon G5 superstorm. Pulls NGS CORS RINEX for Iowa, Illinois, Indiana, and Ohio and computes per-station positioning error envelopes with a climatological model driven by the Kp index. Notebooks, a blog post and result figures."
